        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "A daughter searches for a film script, driven by her father's last words: \"I can't die because I didn't make a movie.\" The film is the incomplete and obscured unfolding of that man, that mystery: an unusual family man, with a variety of jobs and no success, who uses a camera like an obsessive, someone who lives his life observing others.",
